[{"id": "2114815541508477102", "text": "KEYNE IS HERE \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114814614605041664/vid/avc1/720x1280/NxBcSBQ6Z4zmG9uc.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2114817682524475503", "text": "\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc18 \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1d\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27 \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udff4\udb40\udc67\udb40\udc62\udb40\udc65\udb40\udc6e\udb40\udc67\udb40\udc7f", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114816591447613440/vid/avc1/1920x1080/7aMamJ9jT5Y3PZu7.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2114818736184058040", "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 | The Bar\u00e7a delegation on the red carpet at #BallonDOr ceremony. \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2114817890385850368/pu/vid/avc1/1280x720/pSAkeIZbabcw3N7u.mp4?tag=12"}, {"id": "2114820007532110000", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Garc\u00eda: \u201cUnai, David, and I are different, but all three of us deserve to be here. I\u2019m proud of how everything has gone.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlZlwRWwAAu1BP.jpg"}, {"id": "2114820735763894284", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Rodrigo: \u201cWhen a rival is better than you, you have to accept it. The team wasn\u2019t sharp enough. We\u2019re in October, which is the good part. We have to approach what\u2019s left with humility.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlaQINXsAA9eL1.jpg"}, {"id": "2114822786745024789", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \u201cWe have to face it with sportsmanship. I know Lamine is especially excited about it.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udc40", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlcHiCXQAAdDro.jpg"}, {"id": "2114823545230368854", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \u201cI believe Hansi Flick is the perfect coach for Barcelona. He understands our original style of football and greatly admires Johan Cruyff\u2019s philosophy.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlczo0XMAAaSHH.jpg"}, {"id": "2114823719734358192", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Lamine Yamal wins the KOPA TROPHY for the 3rd year in a row. #fcblive \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlc90ZWwAAQAMu.jpg"}, {"id": "2114824077168738510", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Lamine Yamal: \u201cI think this award should have gone to Pau Cubars\u00ed. I think he deserved it the most.\u201d #fcblive #BallonDOr", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVldSpaWAAALOQ_.jpg"}, {"id": "2114825728055234668", "text": "Lamine Yamal \u2013 3 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\nVicky Lopez - 2 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\n\n\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc03\ud835\udc04 \ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00! \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVleyuQXQAIDoOy.jpg"}, {"id": "2114826817349517641", "text": "\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc13  \ud835\udc32\u0336\ud835\udc28\u0336\ud835\udc2e\u0336\ud835\udc27\u0336\u0336\ud835\udc20\u0336 \ud835\udc29\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc32\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc30\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1d \u2b50", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlfyCWXgAAp-Qq.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827223786041539", "text": "\u2757\ufe0f| \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc19\ud835\udc18 \ud835\udc05\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13: Barcelona players have won 5 of the 6 Kopa Trophies awarded since the award was introduced. \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc1a! \ud83d\ude35", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlgJxLWMAAwz1p.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827375540060284", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: The TOP 10 rankings for the 2026 Kopa Trophy!\n\n\ud83e\udd47 Lamine Yamal\n\ud83e\udd48 Pau Cubars\u00ed\n\ud83e\udd49 Warren Za\u00efre-Emery\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Lennart Karl\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Yan Diomand\u00e9\n6\ufe0f\u20e3 Ayyoub Bouaddi\n7\ufe0f\u20e3 Kerim Alajbegovi\u0107\n8\ufe0f\u20e3 Eli Junior Kroupi\n9\ufe0f\u20e3 Ibrahim Maza\n\ud83d\udd1f Johan Manzambi\n\n#fcblive #BallonDOr \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114827703622705633", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: Bar\u00e7a Femeni coach Pere Romeu WINS the Best Women's Football Coach award at the 2026 Ballon D'Or. #fcblive \ud83d\udc4f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlglteXYAAD1wM.jpg"}, {"id": "2114830195832062152", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Luis de la Fuente has been named as Men's Coach of the Year at the 2026 Ballon D'Or.\n\nWell deserved! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVli2v0WMAAhuY6.jpg"}, {"id": "2114833099062128910", "text": "Barcelona and Spain sweeping up everything so far at the #BallonDOr.\n\nCata Coll wins the Women's Best Goalkeeper award and Unai Simon wins the Men's Best Goalkeeper award. \ud83c\udf15\ud83e\udde4", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114835650688020657", "text": "Triple sweep \u2705", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVln0QIWsAEZcGz.jpg"}, {"id": "2114840482450698645", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \"I feel we are the CANDIDATES to win this season's champions league.\" #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlsNiTWsAIbiPt.jpg"}, {"id": "2114840936454783166", "text": "Time really does fly. \ud83e\udd79\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlsn7HXgAA3i_h.jpg"}, {"id": "2114842789363978543", "text": "Yamal x Vozinha \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddfb", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVluT2GWoAAbwBz.jpg"}, {"id": "2114849672535916689", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Alexia Putellas: \u201cI want to dedicate this award to FC Barcelona and all my family and friends.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl0ebfbwAAhQJL.jpg"}, {"id": "2114850001214152850", "text": "\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc00, forever \ud83d\udc78", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl0ziibsAAZyqB.jpg"}, {"id": "2114852454080651506", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Harry Kane is the 2026 Men's Ballon D'Or WINNER. \ud83c\udf15\n\nCongratulations!", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl3GXxWgAAJ7D9.jpg"}, {"id": "2114853006365647169", "text": "We will be back next year \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl3mhoWIAAtsow.jpg"}, {"id": "2114853756193919362", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Lamine Yamal finished THIRD in the Ballon D'Or rankings, behind Mbappe. \ud83c\udf15\u274c", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl4SIGXMAAEc3U.jpg"}, {"id": "2114856120225321087", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udcf2 | Ferm\u00edn on IG:", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVl6byVXUAAhSPr.jpg"}, {"id": "2114860438005395512", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Laporta: \u201cLamine has sufficiently proven his merits to be the Ballon d\u2019Or winner, but it couldn\u2019t happen.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114858240181678081/vid/avc1/1920x1080/2AyV3BYvI6oJwdZs.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2114866371641196867", "text": "Travelled all the way from Madrid to London only to watch others pick up all the awards. \ud83d\ude02", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVmDwhbXQAArAnV.jpg"}, {"id": "2114984536178110612", "text": "\ud835\udc06\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc1d \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc2c \ud83d\udc10", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVnvOkNX0AE7KQ_.jpg"}, {"id": "2114985473810505909", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Vincent Garcia (Editor-in-chief of France football): \"I think that Rodri took some votes away from Lamine in the race.\u201d #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVnwFMUWQAAFD9V.jpg"}]